sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Traveller
    participant UI as Streamlit UI
    participant RT as AgentCore Runtime<br/>agent_invocation()
    participant MEM as AgentCore Memory
    participant R as vacation_researcher
    participant LLM as llama-server (Qwen2.5)
    participant COG as Cognito /oauth2/token
    participant GW as AgentCore Gateway (MCP)
    participant L as Lambda get-data
    participant DB as DynamoDB travel_packages
    participant P as itinerary_planner

    U->>UI: "Travel packages for Mumbai"
    UI->>RT: POST {"topic": "..."} (API Gateway→Lambda or boto3)
    RT->>MEM: list_events(memoryId, actorId="user", sessionId)
    MEM-->>RT: previous events
    RT->>R: crew.kickoff(inputs={topic, previous_conversations})
    R->>LLM: role + goal + research_task instructions + tool schemas
    LLM-->>R: Action: Get Travel Packages {"city": "Mumbai"}
    R->>COG: POST grant_type=client_credentials
    COG-->>R: access_token (JWT)
    R->>GW: JSON-RPC tools/call<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>MCP-Protocol-Version
    GW->>GW: validate JWT (Cognito discovery URL)
    GW->>L: invoke {"city": "Mumbai"}
    L->>DB: get_item(Key={city: {S: "Mumbai"}})
    DB-->>L: Item (plan, cost, duration)
    L-->>GW: {statusCode: 200, body}
    GW-->>R: MCP result content
    R->>LLM: Observation → final answer (15 bullets)
    LLM-->>R: research output
    R->>P: task output (sequential handoff)
    P->>LLM: reporting_task
    LLM-->>P: Markdown itinerary → report.md
    P-->>RT: CrewOutput.raw
    RT->>MEM: create_event(USER topic, ASSISTANT result)
    RT-->>UI: {"result": "<itinerary markdown>"}
    UI-->>U: rendered plan + download button
